<title>USA: TENNIS-SATURDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SATURDAY'S RESULTS FROM THE U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the U.S. Open tennis championships at the National Tennis Centre on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Women's singles, semifinal</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat 16-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Men's 35s doubles Masters, final</p>
<p>Johan Kriek (South Africa) and John Lloyd (Britain) beat Vijay Amritraj (India) and Tim Wilkinson (U.S.) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Men's singles, semifinals</p>
<p>2-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 6-Andre Agassi (U.S.) 6-3 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Junior girls singles, semifinals</p>
<p>8-Mirjana Lucic (Croatia) beat 12-Nicola Hubnerova (Czech Republic) 7-6 (8-6) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>Marlene Weingartner beat 3-Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 2-6 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Mixed doubles Masters, final</p>
<p>1-Wendy Turnbull (Australia) and Tom Okker (Netherlands) vs. 2-Jo Durie (Britain) and Tom Gorman (U.S.). Final cancelled by mutual consent, teams declared co-winners.</p>
<p>Junior boys singles, semifinals</p>
<p>9-Daniel Eisner (Germany) beat 11-Olivier Mutis (France) 4-6 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>7-Markus Hipfl (Austria) beat Kornel Bardoczky (Hungary) 6-1 6-2</p>
<p>Junior girls doubles, final</p>
<p>4-Surina De Beer and Jessica Steck (South Africa) beat Petra Rampre and Katerina Srebotnik (Slovenia) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Men's singles semifinal 1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 4-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-3 6-4 6-7 (9-11) 6-3</p>
<p>Boy's doubles final</p>
<p>4-Bob Bryan and Mike Bryan (U.S.) beat 1-Daniele Bracciali</p>
<p>(Italy) and Jocelyn Robichaud (Canada) 5-7 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
